! Freq at the optimized BP86/6-31G(d,p) geometry (from h2o_dimer_bp86_631dp.log).
! Previously with D3: frequencies were IDENTICAL to no-disp (D3 Hessian missing).
! Now with the D3 FD-Hessian fix, they should differ by ~0.1-0.5 cm^-1.
%method     BP86
%basis      6-31G(d,p)
%job        opt+freq
%dispersion D3
%grid       fine

%geo
